# _uc80_build.py is the PEP 517 backend named by pyproject.toml's
# build-backend/backend-path. It sits at the repo root, so it is not part of
# any package and setuptools would not include it on its own. It must be in
# the sdist: `python -m build` (what .github/workflows/publish.yml runs)
# builds the sdist first and then builds the wheel FROM it, and a missing
# backend module makes that second step fail with "Cannot import
# '_uc80_build'".
include _uc80_build.py
